# website

Marketing / public-facing site. No PHI or clinical data.

- Follow existing styling and component patterns.
- WCAG AA is a floor: 44px minimum targets. Treat a regression as a bug.
- Read `PRODUCT.md`, `DESIGN.md`, and `../Balsm-Core/brand/balsm-brand-canvas.md` before design, styling, or copy work.
- Petal text contrast is a recorded brand-owner exception — do not "fix" by darkening one component.
- Reveal state belongs in CSS, never in an inline style.
- `dark:` follows the `.dark` class, not the OS.

